ProtonPortSync uses PS2EXE by Markus Scholtes to compile the PowerShell
script into an executable.

PS2EXE is MIT licensed.
https://github.com/MScholtes/PS2EXE

This note lives here rather than in LICENSE because GitHub reads LICENSE
automatically to work out what licence a project uses, and anything appended
after the MIT text stops it recognising the file. It was reporting
"NOASSERTION" until this was moved out.
